   "k": "nyncvx",
   "en": "Waking the Tiger (A free DLC[3]) Released on 2018-03-08, now part of the base game. National Focus Trees for China: Guide China or the Communist China through the war, guided by your own vision of the future. Modified Focus Trees: German Reich and Japan, two major Axis powers now have alternate history paths, including the chance to depose Hitler or restore democracy to Japan. General Traits and Abilities: Generals’ traits can now unlock powerful Command Power abilities, allowing great flexibility and creativity. Decisions and Missions: Historical decisions and national missions give new places to spend Political Power, from domestic politics to start special projects. And more: Scavenge equipment from the battlefield, use Volunteer Air Corps, as well as new music and art."
